[gd_scene format=3]

; Moves one variable: a tile's own TileData z_index, which puts its cell in a canvas item of its
; own at that z. The red tile overlaps the right half of the green cell before it and draws over it
; in cell order; the green tile's z_index 1 lifts it back on top. No other tile scene authors a
; TileData z_index.

